.TH get_version 2 2026-11-11 DarqOS "DarqOS Kernel API Manual"
.SH NAME
get_version \- Get DarqOS version
.SH LIBRARY
.I darq
.SH SYNOPSIS
.BR get_version() -> Version

class \fIVersion\fP:
    version: \fIstr\fP
    edition: \fIint\fP
    build: \fIint\fP
 
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR get_version ()
system call is used to obtain the system software version number.  The
value is available both in pre-composed string form, and as an integer
\fIedition\fP and \fIbuild\fP pair.
.SH RETURN VALUE
.SH ERRORS
.SH VERSIONS
This is the first version of this system call.
.SH STANDARDS
None
.SH HISTORY
Introduced in \fISecond Edition\fP.
.LP
Similar to the Unix
.BR uname( 2 )
system call.
.\"
.SH ENVIRONMENT
None
.SH NOTES
None
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
import darq
v = darq.get_version()
print(f"Darq version {v.version}, {v.edition}ed, build {v.build}")
.EE
.SH BUGS
None known.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkernel (8)
